Description: ZeroTier One 1.16.2 for Ubiquiti EdgeOS (self-contained dynamic build)
 Bundles its own glibc 2.35 runtime and loader under /config/zt, so it does
 not depend on the router's older system libc. Started via the bundled loader
 (ztlib/lib64/ld.so.1 --library-path ztlib/lib). Installs an auto-start hook at
 /config/scripts/post-config.d/zerotier-start.sh.
 .
 Why dynamic: static C++ builds from the GCC 10.3 / glibc 2.35 MIPS cross
 toolchain crash at runtime (epc=0 inside std::condition_variable::wait).
 Network ID and identity live in /config/zt/home and survive upgrades.
